{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Some well-known films they both enjoyed","evidence":"[D3:17 | 9:27 am on 7 February, 2022] Joanna: I just watched \"Little Women\" and it was amazing! It's a great story about sisterhood, love, and reaching for your dreams. Definitely a must-see!\n[D10:1 | 11:54 am on 2 May, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, how's it going? I took your reccomendation and watched \"The Lord of the Rings\" Trilogy last night! It was awesome!\n[D22:8 | 11:15 am on 6 October, 2022] Nate: I watched \"Little Women\" recently, and it was great! The acting was awesome and the story was so captivating. Definitely a good one!","itemId":"urn:uuid:14ba0106-e84d-5c30-8f86-642d1415c6fa","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:48694da9c5d71b4b497b55e6858e5450efb7582f84001db295c2ed4ebc7f6e9d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What movies have both Joanna and Nate seen?","referenceAnswer":"\"Little Women\", \"Lord of the Rings\"","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"48694da9c5d71b4b497b55e6858e5450efb7582f84001db295c2ed4ebc7f6e9d"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, she has been considering returning to be closer to her grandmother and extended family","evidence":"[D19:1 | 9:55 am on 22 October, 2023] Caroline: Woohoo Melanie! I passed the adoption agency interviews last Friday! I'm so excited and thankful. This is a big move towards my goal of having a family.\n[D19:3 | 9:55 am on 22 October, 2023] Caroline: Thanks so much, Melanie! It's beautiful! It really brings home how much love's in families - both blood and the ones we choose. I hope to build my own family and put a roof over kids who haven't had that before. For me, adoption is a way of giving back and showing love and acceptance.","itemId":"urn:uuid:16bb6fc7-f608-5cc1-bc34-606db0b99510","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2d1bd9f77b9545de44c6ca3091439badc62e431e69cfd567c0e716b9ab4e3770","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline want to move back to her home country soon?","referenceAnswer":"No; she's in the process of adopting children.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2d1bd9f77b9545de44c6ca3091439badc62e431e69cfd567c0e716b9ab4e3770"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Violin","evidence":"[D21:11 | 5:34 pm on 6 December, 2023] Tim: I'm learning how to play the violin now. I'm mostly into classical music but I'm keen to try out jazz and film scores too. It's a great way to chill and get creative.","itemId":"urn:uuid:1937ba26-7bd0-5374-86a4-f1248608a2d4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:fa8fb1190c026a0eccf2053e03ab279810fa49bd2abab606364042a14ba5f80c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What instrument is Tim learning to play in December 2023?","referenceAnswer":"violin","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"fa8fb1190c026a0eccf2053e03ab279810fa49bd2abab606364042a14ba5f80c"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"- LGBTQ support group (7 May 2023)  \n- School event sharing transgender journey (early June 2023)  \n- LGBTQ+ counseling workshop (mid June 2023)  \n- LGBTQ+ pride parades (June 2023, July 2023, August 2023)  \n- LGBTQ conference (July 2023)  \n- Transgender poetry reading (October 2023)","evidence":"[D17:19 | 10:31 am on 13 October, 2023] Caroline: It was a transgender poetry reading where transgender people shared their stories through poetry. It was extra special 'cause it was a safe place for self-expression and it was really empowering to hear others share and celebrate their identities.\n[D15:13 | 3:19 pm on 28 August, 2023] Caroline: Wow! Did you see that band?","itemId":"urn:uuid:19a0e7ea-3ac4-5bcb-a2f3-814c55e3f7fe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2b1eb283f3972444f3b733348eccbc3d4ef2ce073fae9cf7a3aac2a73656d3bb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What transgender-specific events has Caroline attended?","referenceAnswer":"Poetry reading, conference","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2b1eb283f3972444f3b733348eccbc3d4ef2ce073fae9cf7a3aac2a73656d3bb"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Sentimental jewelry from their moms","evidence":"[D1:8 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Jolene: Staying connected is super important. Do you have something to remember her by? This pendant reminds me of my mother, she gave it to me in 2010  in Paris.\n[D1:9 | 4:06 pm on 23 January, 2023] Deborah: Yes, I also have a pendant that reminds me of my mother. And what is special for you about your jewelry?","itemId":"urn:uuid:1a1174e6-cd0c-5d28-8152-dc49cdb2a1fe","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c39aa63d4e5b024b9e3d7638aa8e29b9f2c87b089d818539a4e13101bc372856","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What symbolic gifts do Deborah and Jolene have from their mothers?","referenceAnswer":"pendants","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c39aa63d4e5b024b9e3d7638aa8e29b9f2c87b089d818539a4e13101bc372856"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
