{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Various tricks and athletic abilities including water and land activities","evidence":"[D2:17 | 9:26 pm on 20 March, 2022] James: They can do tricks like sit, stay, paw, and rollover. Here's a picture of Daisy waiting for a treat. I've done lots of training and they've picked it up fast. They're like my family.\n[D14:17 | 5:07 pm on 16 June, 2022] James: Yeah, he loves it! We usually hit the beach or lake, and he loves playing in the water. He's a pro swimmer!\n[D14:23 | 5:07 pm on 16 June, 2022] James: Max is a real go-getter! He's awesome at catching frisbees in mid-air - never misses!\n[D17:16 | 9:49 am on 22 July, 2022] James: Indeed, I remember this moment. We loved skateboards back then, sometimes we even left class early to do it. I still like to go for a ride sometimes, and I even taught my dogs how to balance on it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:213daf3e-5e39-5180-94f5-60a11e495145","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:547f708aebb4dfd22ae8fdd4d02e57198ff9252bee21f8f98f4e17033acab25f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of tricks do James's pets know?","referenceAnswer":"swimming, catching frisbees, balancing on a skateboard, sit, stay, paw, and rollover","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"547f708aebb4dfd22ae8fdd4d02e57198ff9252bee21f8f98f4e17033acab25f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Gardening","evidence":"[D29:7 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Deborah: Thanks, Jolene! It was really special. My mom had a big passion for cooking. She would make amazing meals for us, each one full of love and warmth. I can still remember the smell of her special dish, it would fill the house and bring us all together.","itemId":"urn:uuid:213fb7ef-4329-5af3-82ae-785861ae782c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ad97d4c2d0d44671912bdae660a1380564c1601be28cb2b04ec436a79098ae6b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What was Deborah's mom passionate about?","referenceAnswer":"Cooking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ad97d4c2d0d44671912bdae660a1380564c1601be28cb2b04ec436a79098ae6b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Journal and creative writing","evidence":"[D6:4 | 4:09 pm on 13 August, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan. Your support means a lot to me. It's tough staying positive, but knowing I have people like you in my corner makes it easier.\n[D11:7 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, that sounds like a fun and unexpected event! It's always interesting how helping someone can turn into a little adventure of its own. And how's your watercolor painting going?","itemId":"urn:uuid:230e6db7-66a4-5e83-81ea-86ccf2361dc7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:456b5640542fa5a8dbf01cf349302ec7a68ebf7ff62c6d9c8bccdece99f0e8fe","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of writing does Sam do to relax and cope with his health issues?","referenceAnswer":"journalling, creative writing","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"456b5640542fa5a8dbf01cf349302ec7a68ebf7ff62c6d9c8bccdece99f0e8fe"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
