{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Completed a major writing project she had been working on","evidence":"[D2:3 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woo! I finally finished my first full screenplay and printed it last Friday. I've been working on for a while, such a relief to have it all done!","itemId":"urn:uuid:2521e45d-a490-598a-be20-a58497a7cbdb","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:132ca2ec6beb9069fb41b407d96b587f253767704d542f835cb31f1195b0850f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What major achievement did Joanna accomplish in January 2022?","referenceAnswer":"finished her screenplay and printed it","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"132ca2ec6beb9069fb41b407d96b587f253767704d542f835cb31f1195b0850f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"National park","evidence":"[D10:12 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Melanie: We always look forward to our family camping trip. We roast marshmallows, tell stories around the campfire and just enjoy each other's company. It's the highlight of our summer!\n[D10:14 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Melanie: I'll always remember our camping trip last year when we saw the Perseid meteor shower. It was so amazing lying there and watching the sky light up with streaks of light. We all made wishes and felt so at one with the universe. That's a memory I'll never forget.","itemId":"urn:uuid:26343f60-22db-5bf7-aa22-560f6da84980","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:710df2d7e46608a7cfd6b1b7db9db2d0d70b1f06ba650ff004b74a0ad021ed9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Melanie be more interested in going to a national park or a theme park?","referenceAnswer":"National park; she likes the outdoors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"710df2d7e46608a7cfd6b1b7db9db2d0d70b1f06ba650ff004b74a0ad021ed9b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Her close support network of loved ones","evidence":"[D12:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 August, 2023] Caroline: Hey Mel! How're ya doin'? Recently, I had a not-so-great experience on a hike. I ran into a group of religious conservatives who said something that really upset me. It made me think how much work we still have to do for LGBTQ rights. It's been so helpful to have people around me who accept and support me, so I know I'll be ok!\n[D3:11 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Mel! My friends, family and mentors are my rocks – they motivate me and give me the strength to push on. Here's a pic from when we met up last week!","itemId":"urn:uuid:263a57d7-588d-5a12-ac51-5bce6423511d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:375039282e64ee8a8bfe89e242189c7d4d4281e4f77a96642e52ec9682b48e09","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who supports Caroline when she has a negative experience?","referenceAnswer":"Her mentors, family, and friends","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"375039282e64ee8a8bfe89e242189c7d4d4281e4f77a96642e52ec9682b48e09"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Deborah lives close to the beach.","evidence":"[D10:17 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Deborah: Don't forget to take it easy and look after yourself. Wishing you all the best! Recently, Anna and I were sitting by the sea, watching the sunset and talking about each other. And we realized that we inspire each other. What thoughts does the sea in this photo make you think of?","itemId":"urn:uuid:2756f54e-0671-571a-b10b-72b862e822e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b9c531dbc91749a7c14e3f45ced62e25da6a2c41fff01465aee414cdaf6e532b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Deborah live close to the beach or the mountains?","referenceAnswer":"beach","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b9c531dbc91749a7c14e3f45ced62e25da6a2c41fff01465aee414cdaf6e532b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Deborah uses daily schedules and to-do lists; Jolene uses Pomodoro Technique and bullet journaling.","evidence":"[D10:4 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Jolene: I'm using the Pomodoro Technique - 25 minutes work, 5-minute break - to avoid burnout but I'm still struggling to prioritize. Do you have any other tips on time management?\n[D10:5 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Deborah: I create a daily schedule or to-do list. Here's my example for today.\n[D10:6 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Jolene: I tried making one but it's kinda overwhelming when it's a big stack of tasks. Here's an example from last Friday.\n[D10:13 | 5:35 pm on 22 March, 2023] Deborah: The Eisenhower Matrix sorts tasks into four boxes, categorizing them based on their urgency and importance. It can be really useful for organizing and prioritizing. Here's a breakdown. \n[D18:3 | 2:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Jolene: Thanks, Deb! I've been trying out some time management strategies recently and started using a bullet journal. It's been really helpful for tracking my tasks and staying organized.","itemId":"urn:uuid:28b65cac-5635-5ab8-b7b0-1a2ef56c2c89","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:15a712eca56c1f71c0d800a8ee6df12e78909f9a10a81b8b6dc7857ac924d9b9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What time management techniques do Deborah and Jolene use?","referenceAnswer":"the Pomodoro Technique - 25 minutes work and 5-minute break, scheduler or to-do list, The Eisenhower Matrix, bullet journal","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"15a712eca56c1f71c0d800a8ee6df12e78909f9a10a81b8b6dc7857ac924d9b9"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Somewhere in North America","evidence":"[D3:9 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Calvin: Thanks, Dave! I'm dreaming of touring the world, performing for different people and connecting with them. I hope my music can reach a global audience and make an impact. I'm also looking forward to my upcoming trip to Boston after I finish the Frank Ocean tour. I've heard that the music scene there is awesome, so I can't wait to check it out!\n[D3:10 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Dave: Sounds like an amazing plan, Cal! I can't wait for your trip to Boston. I'll show you around town and all the cool spots. The music scene there is awesome, with places like Paradise Rock, House of Blues, and Fenway Park. You'll definitely have some great performances there. Count me in for the front row when you're up onstage! Oh, and by the way, check out this pic.","itemId":"urn:uuid:28c0dc08-1141-5658-8dd5-679e0b084ce8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:51610640f5df736f9e00b5c655444122dd7ad79fb23796e8dc69bc67374d1877","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which country do Calvin and Dave want to meet in?","referenceAnswer":"United States","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"51610640f5df736f9e00b5c655444122dd7ad79fb23796e8dc69bc67374d1877"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"boost his assist numbers and earn a spot in the All-Star game","evidence":"[D1:9 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] John: Yeah, my goal is to improve my shooting percentage. Been practicing hard and gonna make it happen.\n[D6:15 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Yeah! Winning a championship is my number one goal. But I also want to make a difference away from the court, like through charity or inspiring people. Basketball has been great to me, so I want to give something back.\n[D11:17 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: Definitely! I'm focusing on better shooting and making more of an impact on the court. I want to be known as a consistent performer and help my team. Off the court, I'm also looking into more endorsements and building my brand. It's important for me to think about life after basketball.","itemId":"urn:uuid:28d4b70c-1dc1-5eb3-b3e1-576cf5bda2f9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:edd89b3c7d8166174534f52e95cdfadec093e8f9f29c43cc7546ddd482fed5b2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"what are John's goals with regards to his basketball career?","referenceAnswer":"improve shooting percentage, win a championship","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"edd89b3c7d8166174534f52e95cdfadec093e8f9f29c43cc7546ddd482fed5b2"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
