{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Before 2 April 2023","evidence":"[D2:1 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, I got a surprise for you! We adopted another puppy called Pixie. She's SO cute! Isn't she just the cutest?","itemId":"urn:uuid:29631103-9982-5afc-aca0-a500b50b6f3e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d973ca351ff4521ea30e64ea29a7d32d546215a007e04c54c483a3d2633979a6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Audrey adopt Pixie?","referenceAnswer":"around April 2, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d973ca351ff4521ea30e64ea29a7d32d546215a007e04c54c483a3d2633979a6"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Screenplays, movie scripts, books, and blog posts","evidence":"[D2:3 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woo! I finally finished my first full screenplay and printed it last Friday. I've been working on for a while, such a relief to have it all done!\n[D17:14 | 2:34 pm on 10 July, 2022] Joanna: I will! I actually started on a book recently since my movie did well!\n[D18:1 | 6:12 pm on 14 August, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no talk! I've been busy with writing projects and really going all out with it. It's been the best thing ever - a mix of highs and lows - and my journal's pretty much my rock. Writing's such a huge part of me now.\n[D18:5 | 6:12 pm on 14 August, 2022] Joanna: Yep. Last week, someone wrote me a letter after reading an online blog post I made about a hard moment in my life. Their words touched me; they said my story had brought them comfort. It was awesome to realize my words had that kind of power. It reminded me why I love writing.","itemId":"urn:uuid:2977f09b-72b3-573d-bfc3-40365c73eb6f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:bf9c419ce6e9eaf8b3d4ccc5bec12333fbd939c29f7c64254fbe0b3952cb5149","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of writings does Joanna do?","referenceAnswer":"Screenplays,books, online blog posts, journal","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"bf9c419ce6e9eaf8b3d4ccc5bec12333fbd939c29f7c64254fbe0b3952cb5149"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"LeBron's work ethic and dedication","evidence":"[D12:20 | 3:00 pm on 2 October, 2023] John: Thanks! The Wolves are my team for sure. And LeBron is the man - love his skills and leadership.\n[D16:12 | 11:41 am on 6 November, 2023] John: LeBron's moments of determination and heart are incredible. It's why I enjoy playing and pushing myself. You never know when those special moments might occur, but it's always fun to be part of it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:29a4d9a9-1a44-56a9-9817-589d706f2b07","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4f0af196ee2c6c04c172c5c5af08fb3cd889cc092c721a05ae68d0a73193a6b2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does John like about Lebron James?","referenceAnswer":"His heart, determination, skills, and leadership.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4f0af196ee2c6c04c172c5c5af08fb3cd889cc092c721a05ae68d0a73193a6b2"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
