{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Adopted Buddy and Scout; hikes, walks, picnics, bike rides, rock climbing, camping, board games, and shelter volunteering.","evidence":"[D14:27 | 11:05 am on 4 August, 2023] Andrew: Thanks! Gotta take Toby out for a small hike at the local trail. Ttyl!\n[D24:8 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: Yeah, Buddy and I have a great time doing walks. It's a nice way to spend time together and get some fresh air.","itemId":"urn:uuid:30ff921c-3969-5d44-9806-5674ed44ead7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ba764c617d0d07d2f64d91e15bfe605c3db8ea5ed060ee05286b1df860d9d34a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What has Andrew done with his dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Taking walks and hiking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ba764c617d0d07d2f64d91e15bfe605c3db8ea5ed060ee05286b1df860d9d34a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A tropical coastal destination in Southeast Asia","evidence":"[D27:1 | 2:18 pm on 12 September, 2023] Jolene: Hey Deb! So sorry for the late reply, been super busy. Last weekend my partner and I traveled to a meditation retreat for a few weeks in Phuket. Amazing experience! Nature, reflection and a break from engineering studies were awesome - it helped me find inner peace.\n[D29:4 | 1:24 pm on 17 September, 2023] Jolene: We tried a scuba diving lesson last Friday and had an awesome time! We found a cool dive spot we can explore together. Trying new things opens up a world of adventure - maybe one day I'll be a certified diver. Anything fun going on with you?","itemId":"urn:uuid:322eefa3-de10-59e6-8eb8-a214dba27580","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Jolene and her partner find a cool diving spot?","referenceAnswer":"Phuket","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f9c31ea1f13c6bced416301435954b000c06ad1987a5872877a34d3ab26f970e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A popular gaming console","evidence":"[D27:23 | 8:10 pm on 7 November, 2022] Nate: Yep! I'm currently playing this awesome fantasy RPG called \"Xeonoblade Chronicles\" and it's been a blast! I highly reccomend it if you've never played it before. ","itemId":"urn:uuid:32a3fbb9-912c-54e6-8c64-f0c9961fdd34","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d7dd27c80c9e2912b32c29a09c15f24af4bbb84cb5f8db183821b277b0744890","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What Console does Nate own?","referenceAnswer":"A Nintendo Switch; since the game \"Xenoblade 2\" is made for this console.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d7dd27c80c9e2912b32c29a09c15f24af4bbb84cb5f8db183821b277b0744890"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Paris","evidence":"[D2:5 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Gina: Wow, nice spot! Where is it? Got any other features you want to think about before you decide? Paris?! That is really great Jon! Never had a chance to visit it. Been only to Rome once.\n[D15:1 | 10:04 am on 19 June, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing great! Still working on my biz. Took a short trip last week to Rome to clear my mind a little.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3329604a-66a7-51a1-a2a8-a7aacf3e14e4","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which city have both Jean and John visited?","referenceAnswer":"Rome","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"951cd5a681e4db5bdf27d88c83c5b9a95fec070ed52aa6deed25f7f624e4b6ec"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Grow his personal brand and give back to the community","evidence":"[D6:15 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] John: Yeah! Winning a championship is my number one goal. But I also want to make a difference away from the court, like through charity or inspiring people. Basketball has been great to me, so I want to give something back.\n[D11:17 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: Definitely! I'm focusing on better shooting and making more of an impact on the court. I want to be known as a consistent performer and help my team. Off the court, I'm also looking into more endorsements and building my brand. It's important for me to think about life after basketball.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3496534f-dcd8-5492-b780-518f18b3548a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6379fcf8f66faed4e3f2812f83ebd70f3d41e89df199ad04ff77731d3cc1a951","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are John's goals for his career that are not related to his basketball skills?","referenceAnswer":"get endorsements, build his brand, do charity work","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6379fcf8f66faed4e3f2812f83ebd70f3d41e89df199ad04ff77731d3cc1a951"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Eczema or chronic dermatitis, given the range of environmental triggers she reacts to.","evidence":"[D5:11 | 6:59 pm on 18 March, 2022] Joanna: I wish I wasn't allergic! I would get two turtles today if I could! I found out recently I'm allergic to cockroaches as well, so who knows if I'll ever get a pet.\n[D2:23 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: I'm allergic to most reptiles and animals with fur. It can be a bit of a drag, but I find other ways to be happy.","itemId":"urn:uuid:35f7a0c4-a870-5af4-b3a1-3ef2eb62d83d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b6a2ffa0e186c4c519e3252ed23037867c9d3d3da4aafccd44a980abaacca662","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What underlying condition might Joanna have based on her allergies?","referenceAnswer":"asthma","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b6a2ffa0e186c4c519e3252ed23037867c9d3d3da4aafccd44a980abaacca662"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Sara and Kyle","evidence":"[D8:4 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! They're doing great. Our one-year-old is so cute, his name is Kyle!\n[D22:7 | 6:59 pm on 5 July, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! That picture was from a trip we took last year for my daughter Sara's birthday - so much fun and good memories! My family motivates me to keep striving for change.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3740268c-8188-5507-8bc4-dafeb8340cb0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:524c66bff471c5d6de0c4ad534acc72196b4cc2bda937923f25abf9b793b6bc4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of John's children?","referenceAnswer":"Kyle, Sara","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"524c66bff471c5d6de0c4ad534acc72196b4cc2bda937923f25abf9b793b6bc4"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"The Cliffs of Moher, Powerscourt Waterfall, Giants Causeway, Ring of Kerry, and Dingle Peninsula because they are iconic Irish landmarks and filming locations.","evidence":"[D1:18 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!\n[D27:21 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] Tim: Definitely Star Wars! It's my favorite and never gets old. What about you, do you have any favorite fantasy films?\n[D28:1 | 5:24 pm on 7 January, 2024] Tim: Hey John, long time no talk. On Friday, I got great news - I'm finally in the study abroad program I applied for! Next month, I'm off to Ireland for a semester.","itemId":"urn:uuid:37d369bc-037c-5122-9fa8-7e12fc7ea90d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d68f132c552399b354150ad4d5d9f76bb4171404934db22b118445fdad0bf56a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which Star Wars-related locations would Tim enjoy during his visit to Ireland?","referenceAnswer":"Skellig Michael, Malin Head, Loop Head, Ceann Sibéal, and Brow Head because they are Star Wars filming locations.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d68f132c552399b354150ad4d5d9f76bb4171404934db22b118445fdad0bf56a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
