{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A North American destination","evidence":"[D16:9 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also love to read, especially while snuggled under the covers on a cold winter day. But now it’s summer and I want something more exciting! By the way, I bought air tickets to Toronto, and I’m leaving the day after tomorrow evening.\n[D16:11 | 5:13 pm on 9 July, 2022] James: I also plan to visit Vancouver. Maybe, I'll go somewhere else.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c21fd6a-6335-5b2c-8544-3541bb357cd0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which country did James book tickets for in July 2022?","referenceAnswer":"Canada","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7029678c051789726acb24753635bea760e5c26cda3f5ee32fe3595258e795b9"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Lots of love and emotional connection","evidence":"[D2:15 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Audrey: You'll love them! They're great for cuddles and companionship.\n[D23:18 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: I think i've said this so many times, but I really can't imagine my life without them - my little family. They always make me smile and give lots of love and companionship. Remember I had a tattoo of my four dogs? So I went to the tattoo parlor and got some more drawings on the tattoo.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c68f1f7-3a5f-562d-ab1d-c71fdb585e08","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6ce0a2fd3eab82111da0a0dd8a1cce17f91073c4598badd17871bd085889a4a8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Audrey get wtih having so many dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Companionship","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6ce0a2fd3eab82111da0a0dd8a1cce17f91073c4598badd17871bd085889a4a8"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Pottery, rock climbing, cycling, baking, swimming","evidence":"[D1:11 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Sam: Nothing so far, but I was thinking about trying painting. Do you have any hobbies you love?\n[D2:10 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan. Like you said, I've been looking for a hobby to stay motivated. I've been thinking about trying painting. Do you think it will help me de-stress?\n[D10:8 | 9:28 am on 11 September, 2023] Sam: Wow Evan, that's an awesome painting! Good on you for finding a way to de-stress. I could really use something like that - maybe I'll give painting a go or find another calming hobby.\n[D13:6 | 4:07 pm on 14 October, 2023] Sam: Thinking about trying something different outdoors. Any suggestions?\n[D13:8 | 4:07 pm on 14 October, 2023] Sam: Kayaking sounds awesome! Haven't tried it yet, but it looks like a fun way to get in some exercise and enjoy nature. I'm definitely considering giving it a try. Thanks!\n[D20:6 | 6:48 pm on 17 December, 2023] Sam: I used to love hiking, but it's been a while since I had the chance to do it.\n[D7:2 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, sorry to hear about what happened. I can imagine how hard it must have been for you. Things haven't been easy for me either. Had a tough week and a doc's appointment, so it was kinda like a wake-up call to take better care of myself. On a bright side, I'm taking a cooking class to learn how to make healthier meals.\n[D7:4 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: The cooking class has been great, I've learned awesome recipes. Last night I made this yummy grilled dish, so good!\n[D7:6 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan! I marinated it with a few different ingredients and grilled it with some veggies. It turned out really flavorful! If you want, I can share more recipes from my cooking class. Just let me know what you're looking for!\n[D21:19 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Sam: \nI do sketch occasionally, but I haven't created anything remarkable yet. I have a feeling I'll have something to show off before long! Seeing your passion for it is inspiring.","itemId":"urn:uuid:3c9a771e-d002-59e0-b0fa-8e39522abb37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5182d437d63e3afcef2de838ab5015498bd86d40c73dccd6d3c1af50b622e113","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What new hobbies did Sam consider trying?","referenceAnswer":"Painting, kayaking, hiking, cooking, running","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5182d437d63e3afcef2de838ab5015498bd86d40c73dccd6d3c1af50b622e113"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
