{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Jewelry made from sea glass and driftwood","evidence":"[D22:5 | 9:41 pm on 6 October, 2023] Audrey: Oh yes! I love making jewelry out of recycled stuff. It's a great way to show my love of creativity and sustainability. I hunt down things like bottle caps, buttons, and broken jewelry, and then turn them into one-of-a-kind pieces. Here's a photo of one of my favorite necklaces. They all hold a special story and have their own appeal. Plus, it's a small step in reducing waste.","itemId":"urn:uuid:4119088d-e8a9-5aa5-a4d0-6028bc24183f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:5e893f4feda6e4e05dc87fa34933ec2f5a482ca7beac9f0c57a704734c97434f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of jewelry does Audrey make?","referenceAnswer":"Jewelry made from recycled objects","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"5e893f4feda6e4e05dc87fa34933ec2f5a482ca7beac9f0c57a704734c97434f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Nature and outdoors provide peace and stress relief.","evidence":"[D22:1 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I’m really getting into this healthier lifestyle—just took my friends on an epic hiking trip last Friday!\n[D22:2 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! That’s fantastic—nothing like a good hike to feel alive. We took the Prius for a long drive to the mountains last weekend. It was perfect until we got into a little scrape on the way back.\n[D9:10 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Evan: Thanks! I went up to the Rocky Mountains, it was so refreshing! The views were stunning and I felt so relaxed. Do you enjoy road trips and exploring nature?\n[D9:11 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Sam: I haven't gone on a road trip in ages, but I love being surrounded by nature. It's so tranquil and refreshing. I'd love to go hiking more, but it can be a bit challenging sometimes. However, I am working on becoming healthier, so maybe a road trip and a hike will be possible soon.","itemId":"urn:uuid:417ad583-09f2-596e-9421-17483831a9f3","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e1577d08f471f2f7cce6feff2e150cfc92a7b2ed1a491ec41d10472984365219","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What role does nature and the outdoors play in Evan and Sam's mental well-being?","referenceAnswer":"Nature and outdoor activities seem to be significant stress relievers and sources of joy for both Evan and Sam. These activities likely contribute positively to their mental well-being.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e1577d08f471f2f7cce6feff2e150cfc92a7b2ed1a491ec41d10472984365219"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
