{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"no","evidence":"[D18:7 | 10:56 am on 13 September, 2023] Calvin: Thanks Dave! Lots of cool stuff happening. Next up, a tour - so excited! After that, I'm off to explore and grow my brand. Can't wait to see what the future has in store!\n[D16:2 | 2:55 pm on 31 August, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! The tour was amazing! I was so pumped from all the energy from the audience. This pic totally captures how I felt. Such an amazing time!\n[D7:1 | 6:06 pm on 31 May, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! Been ages since we chatted. So much has gone down. Touring with Frank Ocean last week was wild. Tokyo was unreal -- the crowd was insane. I felt so alive when performing, can't find the words to express it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:5d1127b7-1e47-58d0-98bf-3cc9ef2c954a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6a386442ed2eb4d33946861708e54979f9c83587252239e04b68402a82fa31cb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Calvin love music tours?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6a386442ed2eb4d33946861708e54979f9c83587252239e04b68402a82fa31cb"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
