{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"On a Friday evening sometime in late August 2023","evidence":"[D15:1 | 11:06 am on 22 August, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!","itemId":"urn:uuid:5f7928f3-7dfe-5e9a-a6d2-fdc48dcdaa4a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:86ba4780355b5883b53bcd0df618f8714f13c19d5815dc520249913a390315df","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Dave host a card-playing night with his friends?","referenceAnswer":"on the Friday before 22 August, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"86ba4780355b5883b53bcd0df618f8714f13c19d5815dc520249913a390315df"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Baked goods","evidence":"[D26:1 | 1:59 pm on 31 July, 2023] Maria: Hey John, I'm doing ok - hope you are too. Some interesting stuff has been going on; last week I dropped off that stuff I baked at the homeless shelter. It was great and I'm more motivated than ever to help people.\n[D25:19 | 6:21 pm on 22 July, 2023] John: Yeah, it's been great for me. Let me know if you need any advice to get started.","itemId":"urn:uuid:608aa2db-408d-588d-9c78-b46ffb5db745","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:62fa17f5c252f69e194109a6dafb0f260348775e776ae92e453e105c4975ab0f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What food item did Maria drop off at the homeless shelter?","referenceAnswer":"Cakes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"62fa17f5c252f69e194109a6dafb0f260348775e776ae92e453e105c4975ab0f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
