{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of times dealing with bureaucratic paperwork","evidence":"[D6:5 | 11:50 am on 16 May, 2023] Calvin: Thanks, Dave. Appreciate the support. Waiting on insurance to kick in so I can start repairs - fingers crossed it won't take too long. Take a look at my creative haven, where I pour my heart into the music.\n[D9:1 | 3:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Calvin: Hi Dave! Nice to hear from you. Since last chat, some things have happened. I had a lil car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!","itemId":"urn:uuid:63550861-fcf4-5d15-969e-91c0795c9e7d","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:fcad0dff106cc9aa792f989c7febc0f347321069fd91c8e142ae6b59c334aec0","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many times has Calvin had to deal with insurance paperwork?","referenceAnswer":"two times","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"fcad0dff106cc9aa792f989c7febc0f347321069fd91c8e142ae6b59c334aec0"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Shortbread cookies","evidence":"[D3:3 | 3:55 pm on 6 June, 2023] Evan: That salad looks yummy! I'm being extra careful with my health lately. I'm trying to eat less processed food and sugary snacks, even though I love ginger snaps. Have you made any changes to your diet recently?\n[D5:5 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Ginger snaps are my weakness for sure! Dealing with health issues has been tough, but it's made me appreciate the good moments more. These are the ones who bring lots of joy even through the hard times.\n[D23:15 | 1:32 pm on 6 January, 2024] Evan: Thanks, Sam! We're having a family get-together tonight and enjoying some homemade lasagna. Super excited! By the way, I've started a new diet—limiting myself to just two ginger snaps a day. What's on your menu tonight?\t\n[D22:12 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Evan: Exactly! They’re packed with nutrients and really easy to make. You also need to try these cookies, they are awesome! I’ll send you the recipes.","itemId":"urn:uuid:637e00ae-455d-54f6-9bfb-26dea057ca2b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9da2a25adaf22992d645e7227b33ba0f29b8fe29e2e7add3faa25df027d9af00","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Evan's favorite food?","referenceAnswer":"Ginger snaps","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9da2a25adaf22992d645e7227b33ba0f29b8fe29e2e7add3faa25df027d9af00"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Through creative collaborations, branded merchandise, online promotions, and engaging content","evidence":"[D5:5 | 9:32 am on 8 February, 2023] Gina: That's awesome! I'm sure you feel great knowing your students are doing so well with dance. It's amazing what it can do for people! Oh, and btw - I've been working hard on my online store and just teamed up with a local artist for some cool designs. Check 'em out!\n[D16:3 | 2:15 pm on 21 June, 2023] Gina: Thanks! This hoodie isn't for sale, it's from my own collection. I made a limited edition line last week to show off my style and creativity - it was tough but worth it!\n[D8:4 | 1:26 pm on 3 April, 2023] Gina: Oof, that's tough, Jon. I got some new offers and promotions going on my online store to try and bring in new customers. It's been a wild ride starting my business, but I'm not giving up!\n[D13:4 | 8:29 pm on 13 June, 2023] Gina: Proud of you for starting your own business! It takes strength to stay hopeful. What are you doing to prep for your dance studio? I have developed a video presentation to teach how to style my fashion pieces, btw. ","itemId":"urn:uuid:64723a3f-c849-5961-83a6-7d2fa882191f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:83470ef0124d15bb68bd7620045404d23c54505b1df02c64d4283898a6755c0c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How did Gina promote her clothes store?","referenceAnswer":"worked with an artist to make unique fashion pieces, made limited-edition sweatshirts, got some new offers and promotions for online store, developed a video presentation showing how to style her pieces","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"83470ef0124d15bb68bd7620045404d23c54505b1df02c64d4283898a6755c0c"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"August 15, 2023","evidence":"[D4:15 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Sam: Starting tomorrow, I will go to the gym and exercise regularly. The sooner I start, the sooner I will see the rewards of this activity.","itemId":"urn:uuid:66a703f6-e283-5026-966f-cde32631cfa0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b261aa18a7dcb2b163f3a5113cefce61495acdedd822c1071a93f408decbce5f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Sam start working out at the gym?","referenceAnswer":"July 28, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b261aa18a7dcb2b163f3a5113cefce61495acdedd822c1071a93f408decbce5f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
