{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Tupac and Dr. Dre","evidence":"[D20:8 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Calvin: We used to rock a song by Tupac and Dr. Dre called \"California Love\". Ah, those were the days!\n[D20:6 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:686fb839-c3b4-57da-92ff-70d98126fc8f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:97cca61e43c10efc4705b9bf3b0ff511f165c2e73f8eda73d7333c961a8b146f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What was the artists Calvin used to listen to when he was a kid?","referenceAnswer":"Tupac and Dr. Dre","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"97cca61e43c10efc4705b9bf3b0ff511f165c2e73f8eda73d7333c961a8b146f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Creative activities, being outdoors, and finding peaceful settings to unwind","evidence":"[D1:14 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Yep, it's a great stress-buster. I started doing this a few years back.\n[D2:10 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Sam: Thanks, Evan. Like you said, I've been looking for a hobby to stay motivated. I've been thinking about trying painting. Do you think it will help me de-stress?\n[D2:11 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Of course, Sam! Painting is a great way to relieve stress and be creative. It gives you the freedom to explore colors and textures and express feelings. I've been doing it for a few years now and it helps me find peace. But unfortunately it won't help you with your weight problem, besides painting I recommend exercising!\n[D2:14 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Sam: Cheers, Evan! I won't stress - just gonna enjoy it.\n[D8:18 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: In painting classes, we've been learning about watercolors. The instructor stresses observing nature and painting what we see. It's a relaxing way to take a break from everyday stress.\n[D10:8 | 9:28 am on 11 September, 2023] Sam: Wow Evan, that's an awesome painting! Good on you for finding a way to de-stress. I could really use something like that - maybe I'll give painting a go or find another calming hobby.\n[D11:8 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Evan: It's been great! I find painting to be a great stress reliever. Here's what I did last week.\n[D16:23 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Sam: Absolutely, Evan! A trip there sounds like the perfect way to de-stress.\n[D18:7 | 8:16 pm on 5 December, 2023] Evan: That smoothie bowl looks fantastic! How was the meeting? Yeah, I've been thinking about trying yoga, something gentle yet effective for stress relief and flexibility. What's your take on it, Sam?\n[D24:19 | 12:17 am on 10 January, 2024] Evan: Yoga's definitely a great start, Sam. It's helped me with stress and staying flexible, which is perfect alongside the diet. And yes, The Godfather is a legendary thing to watch, can be re-watched many times!\n[D24:21 | 12:17 am on 10 January, 2024] Evan:  By the way there are plenty of other low-impact exercises that can be fun. Going on beach sunsets is one of my favorites - good for exercise and totally calming.","itemId":"urn:uuid:6886fbe6-e454-5d6b-88c1-9188b7324af7","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3911f13a5da1d1bffe7d0ff2d467867e33dbb0ec6dcbc498a495c3fd9e2f2fb1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is a stress reliever for Evan?","referenceAnswer":"Drawing, traveling, places with a beautiful view, yoga, sunsets or something comfortable for Evan","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3911f13a5da1d1bffe7d0ff2d467867e33dbb0ec6dcbc498a495c3fd9e2f2fb1"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A particular type of reptile","evidence":"[D5:6 | 6:59 pm on 18 March, 2022] Nate: I'm drawn to turtles. They're unique and their slow pace is a nice change from the rush of life. They're also low-maintenance and calming. Check out this moment I snapped!\n[D26:9 | 3:56 pm on 4 November, 2022] Joanna: Thanks, Nate! They make me think of strength and perseverance. They help motivate me in tough times - glad you find that inspiring!","itemId":"urn:uuid:68d4f4c2-f6f3-54f4-9cf5-0dd234ed0254","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:480e829d184cf2c66c3b80d76f54ce2e2533b7304a35c0d65b56bfce7f274ff1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What animal do both Nate and Joanna like?","referenceAnswer":"Turtles.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"480e829d184cf2c66c3b80d76f54ce2e2533b7304a35c0d65b56bfce7f274ff1"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"three","evidence":"[D3:12 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Dave: Last weekend I went to a car show. Classic cars are so charming and the dedication people put into restoring them is amazing. That's why I'm so into auto engineering. Can't wait to show you some when you come to Boston! Oh, almost forgot to send a photo, look at this beautiful car!\n[D22:1 | 3:13 pm on 8 October, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin! What’s up? Last Friday I went to the car show. I saw some awesome cars and got to mess with car mods! There were so many cool machines around, it was so much fun! Take a look at this beautiful car!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6919b840-a011-5efd-a806-6c86c38a219b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:446f010280d698fb6b7f9472ac42ab122a2894f6514fbff865f345a60c8ec051","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many car shows has Dave attended?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"446f010280d698fb6b7f9472ac42ab122a2894f6514fbff865f345a60c8ec051"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
