{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Fantasy","evidence":"[D15:3 | 5:51 pm on 21 October, 2023] Tim: That castle looks amazing! I hope I get to visit it someday. My writing is going well: I'm in the middle of fantasy novel and it's a bit nerve-wracking but so exciting! All my hard work is paying off. Writing brings such joy and it's incredible how it can create a whole new world. Thanks so much for believing in me!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6d759b4b-d372-57ba-b362-61a0f4e1ef5e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d4971d42bcf7fd2e4620960900ee0fe4b2485733f369f9f0e64b3f7e74967a63","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What genre is the novel that Tim is writing?","referenceAnswer":"Fantasy","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d4971d42bcf7fd2e4620960900ee0fe4b2485733f369f9f0e64b3f7e74967a63"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Game convention","evidence":"[D14:8 | 5:44 pm on 3 June, 2022] Nate: I've been doing great - I just won another regional video game tournament last week! It was so cool, plus I met some new people. Connecting with fellow gamers is always awesome.\n[D23:1 | 10:58 am on 9 October, 2022] Nate: Hey Joanna, it's been a couple days since we last talked. Something exciting happened last Friday. I went to a game convention and met new people who weren't from my normal circle. It was a bit overwhelming but it reminded me of the good times gaming can bring.","itemId":"urn:uuid:6db46381-9a7b-5a32-b976-b032761da8df","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b6c32fa4a55790f69ecca185930e7266b438b1e4a62a0ebaa33f6a0749776d9f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What places has Nate met new people?","referenceAnswer":"A tournament and agaming convention.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b6c32fa4a55790f69ecca185930e7266b438b1e4a62a0ebaa33f6a0749776d9f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
