{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"An online presence focused on his automotive work","evidence":"[D28:8 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work! By the way, I recently started a blog on car mods. It's my way to share my passion with others. Do you have any tips on blogging for me? Just take a look at this beautiful car!\n\n","itemId":"urn:uuid:6f59cdc0-9dc3-5688-93a0-0a861a522dc8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d76b12a88327cb0a75957347afa97d5dfb8489664b3f9bd9df7aa3d41f1f0bb8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Dave recently start a blog about?","referenceAnswer":"Car mods","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d76b12a88327cb0a75957347afa97d5dfb8489664b3f9bd9df7aa3d41f1f0bb8"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Lake Tahoe","evidence":"[D13:14 | 4:07 pm on 14 October, 2023] Sam: We're traveling through Lake Tahoe! I heard it's great for kayaking.","itemId":"urn:uuid:6f60cd81-5680-5153-b25b-229297ec7431","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8715c618e0472dfb3e01686539b30ab95ed358dcc8f10afcea79db1cb11d3a5c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where did Sam and his mate plan to try kayaking?","referenceAnswer":"Lake Tahoe","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8715c618e0472dfb3e01686539b30ab95ed358dcc8f10afcea79db1cb11d3a5c"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"No, Caroline prefers counseling.","evidence":"[D7:5 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Mell! I'm still looking into counseling and mental health jobs. It's important to me that people have someone to talk to, and I want to help make that happen.\n[D7:9 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Caroline: Thanks so much, Mel! Seeing this pic just made me appreciate my love of reading even more. Books guide me, motivate me and help me discover who I am. They're a huge part of my journey, and this one's reminding me to keep going and never give up!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7249af0e-c0b8-5712-8bf0-927868a68f86","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:00e1088a4103b828d1418bdc218fcc8ac31d8e3f02db97bb2f342b646505c022","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline pursue writing as a career option?","referenceAnswer":"LIkely no; though she likes reading, she wants to be a counselor","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"00e1088a4103b828d1418bdc218fcc8ac31d8e3f02db97bb2f342b646505c022"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
