{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Thai food","evidence":"[D25:3 | 10:14 am on 24 October, 2023] Andrew: Ouch! Are you feeling better? Sending healing vibes to you and your pups. So I recently tried out this new spot in town that serves sushi and it was great. Do you have anything that you've been wanting to try lately?","itemId":"urn:uuid:7355b974-0df7-59ac-bbdb-0d90701cb116","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d374364ed6f44d26ee51ba12d45ae626064a9e408c0cda8342469be9b75702cc","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What cuisine did Andrew recently try at a new spot in town?","referenceAnswer":"sushi","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d374364ed6f44d26ee51ba12d45ae626064a9e408c0cda8342469be9b75702cc"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A few different natural settings outdoors","evidence":"[D6:16 | 8:18 pm on 6 July, 2023] Melanie: Glad you have support, Caroline! Unconditional love is so important. Here's a pic of my family camping at the beach. We love it, it brings us closer!\n[D4:6 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Melanie: That sounds great, Caroline! It's awesome having stuff around that make us think of good connections and times. Actually, I just took my fam camping in the mountains last week - it was a really nice time together!\n[D8:32 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Melanie: Yeah, Caroline, my family's been great - their love and support really helped me through tough times. It's awesome! We even went on another camping trip in the forest.","itemId":"urn:uuid:74516fb7-cadf-5307-b6f2-c58443c75b85","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Where has Melanie camped?","referenceAnswer":"beach, mountains, forest","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"85b7e5f7678bb6d546fba0df9072baf15d20eb19d109b4242aecbbf521e5610d"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Something related to fitness or healthy cooking would be a thoughtful choice.","evidence":"[D2:9 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Yeah, what worked for me was finding a fitness routine I really enjoy. It's my go-to, I love the feeling of being healthy and strong. Making it fun and finding little ways to make smarter choices in my diet really added up. Don't forget, you got this!\n[D3:1 | 3:55 pm on 6 June, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! Long time no talk! How're you doing? Life's been quite the rollercoaster lately. I had a health scare last week – a sudden heart palpitation incident that really shook me up. It's been a serious wake-up call about my lifestyle.\n[D3:3 | 3:55 pm on 6 June, 2023] Evan: That salad looks yummy! I'm being extra careful with my health lately. I'm trying to eat less processed food and sugary snacks, even though I love ginger snaps. Have you made any changes to your diet recently?\n[D3:5 | 3:55 pm on 6 June, 2023] Evan: Yeah, breaking habits can be tough. Making small changes can have a big impact later on. Have you considered swapping soda for flavored seltzer water? It's still bubbly and tasty, but without the sugar. And instead of candy, you could try dark chocolate with high cocoa content - it's a healthier option. What do you think?\n[D4:10 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: Definitely, how about some flavored seltzer with some air-popped popcorn or fruit? It's yum and healthy! The novel I'm reading is \"The Great Gatsby\".\n[D14:12 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Evan: Sure thing! Our hike is going to be awesome, I can tell. I'm always here to support you.\n[D5:9 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Thanks Sam! My family motivates me to stay healthy. Well, it helps a lot with my health goals. It tracks my progress really well and serves as a constant reminder to keep going.\n[D7:3 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear you had a rough week. At least it's forcing us both to take better care of ourselves, right? I hear the class you're taking is packed with healthy recipes. How's it been going? Have you picked up any yummy new meals?\n[D7:2 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, sorry to hear about what happened. I can imagine how hard it must have been for you. Things haven't been easy for me either. Had a tough week and a doc's appointment, so it was kinda like a wake-up call to take better care of myself. On a bright side, I'm taking a cooking class to learn how to make healthier meals.\n[D7:5 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Evan: Mmm, it looks delicious! What did you put in it? I want to eat healthy, so what kind of recipes do you suggest?\n[D7:12 | 4:20 pm on 15 August, 2023] Sam: I have been feeling a mix of emotions - somewhat concerned about my health but also motivated to make positive changes. Taking things one step at a time.\n[D8:1 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, some big news: I'm on a diet and living healthier! Been tough, but I'm determined.\n[D8:5 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Sam: Yes, there are many, such as more energy and less sluggishness after eating. This is really encouraging!\n[D8:7 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Sam: Sure, I'm loving this recipe I found. It's a flavorful and healthy grilled chicken and veggie stir-fry. Wanna give it a go?\n[D8:8 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: Mmm, looks yummy! Is the sauce a family secret? I'm always down to try new recipes!\n[D8:12 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: Thanks Sam! I'll give it a shot and let you know how it went. Trying out new recipes is a great way to stay busy and creative. By the way, I also started taking a painting classes few days ago and I'm really enjoying it. It's all about trying new things, right?\n[D9:1 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! Exciting news: I started a new diet and exercise routine last Monday and it's made a huge difference. I feel great! What about you, what changes have you made recently?","itemId":"urn:uuid:75b56edb-5ae1-5479-a882-f666a4b64e06","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c382786594a71b37be2ec383586f6d0f4dfc9a3fade5480b672666ac4e6ad77a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"In light of the health and dietary changes discussed, what would be an appropriate gift for both Evan and Sam to encourage their healthy lifestyles?","referenceAnswer":"a cookbook with healthy recipes or a subscription to a healthy meal delivery service.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c382786594a71b37be2ec383586f6d0f4dfc9a3fade5480b672666ac4e6ad77a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Something creative related to places and experiences he loves","evidence":"[D4:1 | 4:17 pm on 2 August, 2023] Tim: Hey John! How've you been? Something awesome happened - I'm writing articles about fantasy novels for an online mag. It's so rewarding!\n[D6:6 | 1:08 pm on 11 August, 2023] Tim: I can just imagine the thrill of being in that kind of atmosphere. Must've been an amazing experience for you! BTW, I have been writing more articles - it lets me combine my love for reading and the joy of sharing great stories. Here's my latest one!\n[D15:3 | 5:51 pm on 21 October, 2023] Tim: That castle looks amazing! I hope I get to visit it someday. My writing is going well: I'm in the middle of fantasy novel and it's a bit nerve-wracking but so exciting! All my hard work is paying off. Writing brings such joy and it's incredible how it can create a whole new world. Thanks so much for believing in me!\n[D27:37 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] Tim: I love traveling too. That picture is awesome. Have you been to Paris? The Eiffel Tower is so cool!","itemId":"urn:uuid:775803e1-3061-5ef8-a12f-5c0d109bf144","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:be926b017c52bf4f715c4020deceda386b2f807616dff866b19d041b06789a8d","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What would be a good hobby related to his travel dreams for Tim to pick up?","referenceAnswer":"Writing a travel blog.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"be926b017c52bf4f715c4020deceda386b2f807616dff866b19d041b06789a8d"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"They support different English football clubs","evidence":"[D13:12 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] James: Of course, they played well! As I like to say, there is no sport better than football, no club better than Liverpool! I don't miss a single match of theirs!\n[D13:15 | 4:30 pm on 13 June, 2022] John: As a Manchester City fan, I can't agree with you. You'll see, our two teams will fight for the championship, and mine will win!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7a5a8bdb-8494-53f4-887f-de1347b9d012","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:8bd69832199a12350fef7cbce017aae059328d53bf17424611857acce47b634b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Are John and James fans of the same football team?","referenceAnswer":"No, James is a Liverpool fan and John is a Manchester City fan.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"8bd69832199a12350fef7cbce017aae059328d53bf17424611857acce47b634b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Vinyasa Yoga","evidence":"[D20:2 | 9:52 am on 1 December, 2023] John: Hi Tim! Congrats on your success! Keep it up, you're doing great! I'm also trying out yoga to get a little extra strength and flexibility. It's challenging but worth it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7b45a296-d79c-544f-b419-8e2dc68ee4ea","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:320c1ee2ca85735444346f9a9490380c383bb6b340dc2457dcac4c7d386e7f98","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of yoga for building core strength might John benefit from?","referenceAnswer":"Hatha Yoga","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"320c1ee2ca85735444346f9a9490380c383bb6b340dc2457dcac4c7d386e7f98"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Around late January 2022","evidence":"[D2:3 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woo! I finally finished my first full screenplay and printed it last Friday. I've been working on for a while, such a relief to have it all done!","itemId":"urn:uuid:7b62f2e1-1dbe-5e8f-b65d-0d54198dfd7c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:cee17d29420ad91e76a7c950fbab7b19305da130a71eefc196876dc5e2e33cc1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Joanna finish her first screenplay?","referenceAnswer":"The Friday before 23January, 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"cee17d29420ad91e76a7c950fbab7b19305da130a71eefc196876dc5e2e33cc1"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Something in the social services field","evidence":"[D32:14 | 11:08 am on 16 August, 2023] Maria: Hey John, I'm here for you. Last Friday, I spent some time at the shelter volunteering at the front desk. Seeing the smiles on their faces when they got food or a bed really made me feel good. We have the power to make a difference in people's lives.\n[D5:8 | 1:17 pm on 28 January, 2023] Maria: I started volunteering to help make a difference. My aunt believed in volunteering, and used to help my family out when we were struggling, so I'm inspired by her. It makes me happy knowing I can brighten somebody's day.\n[D11:10 | 6:13 pm on 10 April, 2023] Maria: I recently gave a few talks at the homeless shelter I volunteer at. It was really fulfilling and I received lots of compliments from other volunteers. It was a great reminder about why connecting with and helping others is so important. And, I bought a cross necklace to feel closer to my faith- which has made me happy.\n[D27:4 | 6:20 pm on 3 August, 2023] Maria: I started volunteering here about a year ago after witnessing a family struggling on the streets. It made me want to help, so I reached out to the shelter and asked if they needed any volunteers. They said yes, and it has been a really fulfilling experience for me since then.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7d71bddf-fa43-5315-9ef2-57babe698044","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:08e2e5ed160c014e32a69109152e64fc78fbb0959f04b89ff460982d903fb56c","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What job might Maria pursue in the future?","referenceAnswer":"Shelter coordinator, Counselor","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"08e2e5ed160c014e32a69109152e64fc78fbb0959f04b89ff460982d903fb56c"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Chicken","evidence":"[D10:13 | 8:32 pm on 3 July, 2023] Audrey: I love cooking! My favorite recipe is Chicken Pot Pie. It's so cozy and delicious, especially on a cold day. If you want, I can share the recipe with you.\n[D10:23 | 8:32 pm on 3 July, 2023] Audrey: Sure! Roasted Chicken is one of my favorites - sure I'll send you the recipe in a bit.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7db66b67-6ca3-56f1-a5ee-abf5edeb7700","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:9df6ab53422a7d20993a0a88de5580ac08391d212dd014eb27d568350c375f3e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which meat does Audrey prefer eating more than others?","referenceAnswer":"chicken","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"9df6ab53422a7d20993a0a88de5580ac08391d212dd014eb27d568350c375f3e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Likely yes, since she has always had a strong personal drive to help others regardless of her own experiences","evidence":"[D4:15 | 10:37 am on 27 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks, Melanie. It really mattered. My own journey and the support I got made a huge difference. Now I want to help people go through it too. I saw how counseling and support groups improved my life, so I started caring more about mental health and understanding myself. Now I'm passionate about creating a safe, inviting place for people to grow.\n[D3:5 | 7:55 pm on 9 June, 2023] Caroline: Thanks Mel! Your kind words mean a lot. Sharing our experiences isn't always easy, but I feel it's important to help promote understanding and acceptance. I've been blessed with loads of love and support throughout this journey, and I want to pass it on to others. By sharing our stories, we can build a strong, supportive community of hope.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7dea8118-acc6-5e88-b948-8c7f089a41c1","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b8af9fcc7fa6712c27ef7ecc0d689dc7c4f7f892c6957bb4938094d57e76d411","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Would Caroline still want to pursue counseling as a career if she hadn't received support growing up?","referenceAnswer":"Likely no","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b8af9fcc7fa6712c27ef7ecc0d689dc7c4f7f892c6957bb4938094d57e76d411"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"His new laptop crashing, particularly with the email client freezing up.","evidence":"[D11:15 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Drawing is cool. I'm still just learning how to draw, but I love expressing myself through writing. It's therapeutic and helps me sort out my feelings. Though, I've been a bit frustrated lately with my new phone. Its navigation app keeps malfunctioning, making getting around a bit of a challenge.\n[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e1c997c-dbc4-5e02-9367-18a596faebf0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d07d6e7f2add7c99a1c0c4a5f3be1cdca41720932d32cd3be730576d45cff308","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Sam's persistent problem with his phone?","referenceAnswer":"His new phone malfunctioning, particularly with the navigation app.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d07d6e7f2add7c99a1c0c4a5f3be1cdca41720932d32cd3be730576d45cff308"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Tattoo of her four dogs","evidence":"[D3:26 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Audrey: I know right? They mean the world to me. So much that I got tattoos of them on my arm.\n[D15:1 | 9:58 pm on 16 August, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, since we last spoke I got another tattoo of my four dogs on my arm! They really mean a lot to me so I thought it'd be nice to have them with me wherever I go. What've you been up to?\n[D23:20 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: Thanks! I think right now its enough. Unless someday I decide to get another dog. Maybe I'll get another tattoo when that happens.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e59170c-8515-5110-84ee-11e82c2baf4c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of tattoo does Audrey have on her arm?","referenceAnswer":"Tattoos of her four dogs.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6cf6d40e41d9bb7cddb493eee14fcc579acd816b2d947f096364c5c469c5ceaa"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
