{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Around the middle of 2022","evidence":"[D25:9 | 8:56 pm on 20 September, 2022] John: Thanks James! I kept it a secret because I would have been very upset if I had told you about her in advance and then it wouldn't have worked out. I've been working on this for the past few months and I'm really proud of how it's turned out. It's a 2D adventure game with puzzles and exploration. Here's a screenshot.","itemId":"urn:uuid:99647366-29ab-58cd-bba8-3ccc5ef09420","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a521be66bcea2f46db6b11c6fc0848a4ab2bc3dd4faf4155502311f4c64ce5d8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John start working on his 2D Adventure mobile game?","referenceAnswer":"approximately summer of 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a521be66bcea2f46db6b11c6fc0848a4ab2bc3dd4faf4155502311f4c64ce5d8"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"She is in a committed relationship","evidence":"[D2:5 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: My husband and I are trying to be as good a family as my parents were!\n[D19:11 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Deborah: Reminds me of when I used to play games with my husband. We'd take turns and it was a great way to bond and make memories. Gaming really can bring people closer, right?\n[D23:4 | 11:46 am on 30 August, 2023] Deborah: Yep, last month I visited my mom`s house which holds a special place in my heart. My mom had good and bad times there, but it's still a symbol of her strength and the love she shared with me. This is my husband in front of this house.\n[D28:11 | 3:09 pm on 15 September, 2023] Deborah: That beach is super special to me. It's where I got married and discovered my love for surfing. It's always filled with joy and peace.","itemId":"urn:uuid:9a8c8a48-abc7-50fb-80d5-9c7b46301c56","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Is Deborah married?","referenceAnswer":"yes","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb545b77a9d81b788a94af98acbe1dc1ab6b46c7a8dbaf4d7d00a354c751349"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
