{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"John Williams","evidence":"[D8:14 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] Tim: Thanks! I love playing different songs on the piano, but my favorite one to jam to is a theme from a movie I really enjoy. It brings back lots of great memories.\n[D8:16 | 4:29 pm on 21 August, 2023] Tim: Yeah, \"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\" is special to me. It was the first movie from the series and brings back some great memories. Watching it with my family was amazing. It was so magical!","itemId":"urn:uuid:9ec85931-6d3c-56c4-afc3-851b78f22f25","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f4199cc07ddfac4002f82660107d77bd3a91931264dbae0addd4dd0e3e0d06ca","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which popular music composer's tunes does Tim enjoy playing on the piano?","referenceAnswer":"John Williams","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f4199cc07ddfac4002f82660107d77bd3a91931264dbae0addd4dd0e3e0d06ca"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"United Kingdom","evidence":"[D1:18 | 7:48 pm on 21 May, 2023] Tim: I went to a place in London a few years ago - it was like walking into a Harry Potter movie! I also went on a tour which was amazing. Have you been to any of the real Potter places? I'd love to explore them someday!\n[D13:1 | 1:50 pm on 13 October, 2023] Tim: Hey John! It's been ages since we last talked. Guess what? Last week I went to a Harry Potter conference in the UK - it was incredible! There were so many people who shared the same love of HP as me, it was like a magical family. I felt so inspired and like I got a new lease of life. I love how my passion for fantasy stuff brings me closer to people from all over the world, it's pretty cool.\n[D18:1 | 3:59 pm on 16 November, 2023] Tim: Hey John! Hope you're doing good. Guess what? I went to a castle during my trip to the UK last Friday and it was unbelievable! The architecture and the history were amazing!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a0530485-aa0a-5f2a-99dd-75e50e647e3a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"which country has Tim visited most frequently in his travels?","referenceAnswer":"UK","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2b49789b2ebc3ca1c9e82b5c1b77811b55fddda040fefd3ce38a2697b1062721"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A wide range of outdoor sports and creative activities","evidence":"[D1:14 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Yep, it's a great stress-buster. I started doing this a few years back.\n[D1:6 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: We all hiked the trails last week - the views were amazing!\n[D4:8 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: Go for it, Sam! It's tough at first, but you got this. Try flavored seltzer water instead. It can be a great alternative to soda. Btw I can't stop thinking about that new mystery novel I started. It's so gripping!\n[D6:1 | 4:09 pm on 13 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, long time no talk! Hope you're doing great. I just got back from a rad vacay with my new SO in Canada. Tried some awesome activities too - think hiking, biking... all that cool stuff. We loved exploring the outdoors together, it was so awesome!\n[D8:30 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Evan: Skiing, snowboarding, and ice skating are all fun winter activities I enjoy.\n[D9:6 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Evan: Yeah, PT for my knee is on the cards. Hopefully I'll get an appointment soon. Till then, just keeping it low-key and swimming to stay active.\n[D25:8 | 9:37 pm on 11 January, 2024] Evan: Glad to hear it! Nature really has a way of calming and reviving the soul. Last summer, I took this pic on a camping trip - it was such an amazing sunset. Moments like these remind us of the beauty of life, even during tough times.\n[D25:10 | 9:37 pm on 11 January, 2024] Evan: I had a great time kayaking and watching the sunset last summer - it was truly unforgettable. Being out on the water is so peaceful.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a14fd2e8-4fc0-593b-9be1-d8b2f9aacc3e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7227a12eb1e6666a31cdc2047a423d6307915f9de4ef8b1147ce8e65314c2d5f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of hobbies does Evan pursue?","referenceAnswer":"painting, hiking, reading books, biking, skiing, snowboarding, ice skating, swimming, camping, kayaking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7227a12eb1e6666a31cdc2047a423d6307915f9de4ef8b1147ce8e65314c2d5f"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Brave, genuine, and compassionate","evidence":"[D16:18 | 12:09 am on 13 September, 2023] Melanie: The sign was just a precaution, I had a great time. But thank you for your concern, you're so thoughtful!\n[D13:16 | 3:31 pm on 23 August, 2023] Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's amazing. You really care about being real and helping others. Wishing you the best on your adoption journey!\n[D7:4 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Melanie: Wow, Caroline. We've come so far, but there's more to do. Your drive to help is awesome! What's your plan to pitch in?","itemId":"urn:uuid:a1bac4e1-f476-5c36-be61-88b2d5cd200c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a05ebdb7b8b23bc0f1c69a79f0b6880fe7cef57a6073c47e7da4287f949c90a7","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What personality traits might Melanie say Caroline has?","referenceAnswer":"Thoughtful, authentic, driven","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a05ebdb7b8b23bc0f1c69a79f0b6880fe7cef57a6073c47e7da4287f949c90a7"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
