{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"It motivates others to learn about car mechanics","evidence":"[D28:10 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a69a1704-7ce9-5e2a-aaea-f650db68c5cf","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of impact does Dave's blog on car mods have on people?","referenceAnswer":"It inspires others to start their DIY projects","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a36dd4631889ee119aa3291e1e1cb103735c7dcf34301294881e5b5e94937c0b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Classic rock","evidence":"[D2:10 | 4:45 pm on 26 March, 2023] Dave: Wow, there were so many great bands! If I had to pick a favorite, it would definitely be Aerosmith. Their performance was incredible. I'll show you a pic I took when they were playing.\n[D28:40 | 5:46 pm on 2 November, 2023] Dave: Lately, I've been getting into classic rock. The music from that era is timeless.\n[D10:11 | 7:56 pm on 7 July, 2023] Dave: Nope, never been to Japan but I'm so keen to go one day. I've heard it's full of vibes, good eats and awesome tech. Plus, being able to experience the culture would be amazing - I'm hooked on their music!","itemId":"urn:uuid:a7a311dc-c6d9-5c00-8c5d-077feaf2a523","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c3e3bd468121efc0f2088960a3d7afa7da31e99f1d6e2d99a11e9d62542992a6","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of music does Dave listen to?","referenceAnswer":"classic rock, Japanese music","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c3e3bd468121efc0f2088960a3d7afa7da31e99f1d6e2d99a11e9d62542992a6"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Volunteering at homeless shelter","evidence":"[D3:5 | 8:30 pm on 1 January, 2023] John: We held some events and got to meet some people. We went to a homeless shelter to give out food and supplies. Seeing the smiles on their faces, we knew we made a real difference. We also organized a toy drive for kids in need. It was amazing seeing the community come together to spread some joy.\n[D2:1 | 6:10 pm on 22 December, 2022] Maria: Hey John, been a few days since we chatted. In the meantime, I donated my old car to a homeless shelter I volunteer at yesterday. How's the campaign going? I'm keen to hearabout it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:a869e3fa-0e50-5f81-98b6-993979307310","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of volunteering have John and Maria both done?","referenceAnswer":"Volunteering at a homeless shelter","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4d6525cacba47ba95ee207eac92a97552dcd7aeeeff558dec47ce068f0bfa95a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Having interesting encounters while out in public with people who need directions","evidence":"[D11:6 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Evan: I do my favorite watercolor painting to keep me busy. It's a chill way to relax and get into the colors. By the way, something happened two weeks ago! You're not gonna believe this, I had a bit of an adventure recently. Helped a lost tourist find their way, and we ended up taking an unexpected tour around the city. It was a blast!\n[D14:2 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear about that. Gastritis can be tough. Taking care of ourselves is important. BTW, I've been focusing on fitness and it's been really beneficial for my overall well-being. Funny thing, I had another encounter with a lost tourist recently. Seems like helping tourists is becoming a recurring theme in my life!","itemId":"urn:uuid:aab246de-094a-5a77-a818-905c8768c7fa","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4e7afdba6c751b82da76688eb37d4333e848e56c71ca6ae3f7cdf63fd2897b1e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What recurring adventure does Evan have with strangers?","referenceAnswer":"Helping lost tourists and experiencing unexpected adventures in the city.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4e7afdba6c751b82da76688eb37d4333e848e56c71ca6ae3f7cdf63fd2897b1e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Getting married","evidence":"[D22:4 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Evan: Yeah, we were fine, thanks. Just a minor accident, but it put a bit of a damper on telling my work friends about getting married. They’ve been a great support, though.","itemId":"urn:uuid:abc2db50-a1eb-5840-ad20-cd03123091fb","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0147ba505161c52ca0b4004d5ce43f3b626ceabe8e44771b7ee34f9a410853f1","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did Evan want to share with his work friends?","referenceAnswer":"getting married","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0147ba505161c52ca0b4004d5ce43f3b626ceabe8e44771b7ee34f9a410853f1"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Organizing fundraisers, volunteering at shelters, hosting discussion panels, and running a support hotline","evidence":"[D10:3 | 8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023] Caroline: Hey Mel! A lot's happened since we last chatted - I just joined a new LGBTQ activist group last Tues. I'm meeting so many cool people who are as passionate as I am about rights and community support. I'm giving my voice and making a real difference, plus it's fulfilling in so many ways. It's just great, you know?\n[D5:1 | 1:36 pm on 3 July, 2023] Caroline: Since we last spoke, some big things have happened. Last week I went to an LGBTQ+ pride parade. Everyone was so happy and it made me feel like I belonged. It showed me how much our community has grown, it was amazing!\n[D9:12 | 2:31 pm on 17 July, 2023] Caroline: Yay! Next month I'm having an LGBTQ art show with my paintings - can't wait!\n[D9:2 | 2:31 pm on 17 July, 2023] Caroline: Hey Melanie! That sounds great! Last weekend I joined a mentorship program for LGBTQ youth - it's really rewarding to help the community.","itemId":"urn:uuid:acfa5cb0-2442-59c7-8fc4-8214886e9d31","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d2b466acbb48b282362a2fb24e55c1aa8daab6c4541b39503600d4a0f039f5a4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"In what ways is Caroline participating in the LGBTQ community?","referenceAnswer":"Joining activist group, going to pride parades, participating in an art show, mentoring program","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d2b466acbb48b282362a2fb24e55c1aa8daab6c4541b39503600d4a0f039f5a4"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Various outdoor and community activities together","evidence":"[D25:2 | 6:21 pm on 22 July, 2023] Maria: Hey John, glad work is going well! Having a good team is so important. I had a great experience last weekend hiking with my church  friends - it was great to be surrounded by supportive people and to enjoy nature. Felt so refreshing!\n[D24:6 | 3:34 pm on 17 July, 2023] Maria: Yeah, last weekend I had a picnic with some friends from church. We chilled under the trees, played games, and ate yummy food. It was great!\n[D28:5 | 5:19 pm on 5 August, 2023] John: Thanks Maria! I may have found a job at a tech company I like that needs my mechanical skills for their hardware team. It feels different, but I think it's a great opportunity to learn and contribute.","itemId":"urn:uuid:b000a9e6-4c24-53ad-8fc5-523c47cfe63a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:3e90780531d0647e78eca5ed86d53cd71b86fae24242f42e93439e4f62e6732e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What activities has Maria done with her church friends?","referenceAnswer":"Hiking, picnic, volunteer work","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"3e90780531d0647e78eca5ed86d53cd71b86fae24242f42e93439e4f62e6732e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Laura and Cindy","evidence":"[D27:8 | 6:20 pm on 3 August, 2023] Maria: One of the residents at the shelter, Cindy, wrote it. It's a heartfelt expression of gratitude and shows the impact of the support they receive.\n[D21:19 | 8:43 pm on 3 July, 2023] Maria: One of the shelter residents, Laura, wrote us a letter expressing their gratitude. The impact we made on their life was inspiring!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b1c46752-c86e-53a9-a47a-cd60b3c4df37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:890ba24a02d3ee1133c2272a4e380b6b928075820ef98a4a35744abe350ff33e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who have written notes of gratitude to Maria?","referenceAnswer":"Cindy, Laura","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"890ba24a02d3ee1133c2272a4e380b6b928075820ef98a4a35744abe350ff33e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Salads, sandwiches, homemade desserts, banana split sundae","evidence":"[D13:18 | 3:18 pm on 4 May, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! It had lots of great things like salads, sandwiches, and homemade desserts. My favorite is the amazing banana split sundae - I enjoy it after a day of volunteering. It's a little moment of joy in life - balance is key!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b1f7e526-2807-577b-8c9b-ec6854ac7e95","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:638f5ce6d5dfa65496309abf0f1254b5a066fd840b33d92797e8271a5808c8d9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What kind of food did Maria have on her dinner spread iwth her mother?","referenceAnswer":"Salads, sandwiches, homemade desserts","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"638f5ce6d5dfa65496309abf0f1254b5a066fd840b33d92797e8271a5808c8d9"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Running and pottery","evidence":"[D7:22 | 4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023] Melanie: I've been running farther to de-stress, which has been great for my headspace.\n[D5:4 | 1:36 pm on 3 July, 2023] Melanie: Wow, Caroline! That's great! I just signed up for a pottery class yesterday. It's like therapy for me, letting me express myself and get creative. Have you found any activities that make you feel the same way?","itemId":"urn:uuid:b34747be-308b-5b08-825e-e2cb930c5d4c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:02680a1fc67fef8601a70810745742e44e94f1b4fabd686b011d742372a702d2","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Melanie do to destress?","referenceAnswer":"Running, pottery","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"02680a1fc67fef8601a70810745742e44e94f1b4fabd686b011d742372a702d2"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Spending time in nature brings perspective and gratitude","evidence":"[D30:12 | 10:54 am on 17 November, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, nature really does the trick. Its beauty helps us appreciate life when it's tough. Like a breath of fresh air!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b5a087f4-3677-5a22-8aa4-bb7cd45ba7e9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0c8f01fd3fa8655dcfcc15bf0cc6e34e2e6bb108d16dc28b292f4e23371ba122","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What positive impact does Calvin mention nature has on tough times?","referenceAnswer":"Nature helps us appreciate life","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0c8f01fd3fa8655dcfcc15bf0cc6e34e2e6bb108d16dc28b292f4e23371ba122"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
