{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"17 August 2023","evidence":"[D19:2 | 12:52 am on 19 August, 2023] Jolene: Life's been hella busy since we last talked. I bought a console for my partner as a gift on the 17th and it's so much fun, he even managed to play it.! Engineering studies are still going strong too. Balance has been key for me lately. How about you? What's been up?","itemId":"urn:uuid:b5f19a27-c44c-534b-abf8-db8ac631dacb","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:622e785fa3359e4a6dffb06dc62efc4702b9381f0ef99a687c353c3b85d5b95a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Jolene gift her partner a new console?","referenceAnswer":"17 August, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"622e785fa3359e4a6dffb06dc62efc4702b9381f0ef99a687c353c3b85d5b95a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"He is always looking to reach more listeners and expand his audience.","evidence":"[D12:11 | 1:12 pm on 3 August, 2023] Calvin: My plan for now is to expand my brand worldwide and grow my fanbase. I want my music to reach more people and make an impact. Working with artists from around the globe and challenging myself to create special music are goals of mine too. Look at the photo of how I performed with the boys last night, they are great at the music!\n[D27:1 | 10:49 am on 29 October, 2023] Calvin: Hey Dave! Since we last talked, I went to a networking event to meet more artists. So cool! The people I met will help me build up my fan base. Super excited about what it could lead to. You? Anything new since we last spoke?","itemId":"urn:uuid:b6802820-0c67-5561-848f-b5dc37a87a50","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:38d1d6934c5662e937494fd39e30f608dcdecb7b1ed93024f384fd75e467e6ca","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Calvin wish to become more popular?","referenceAnswer":"Yes; he want's to grow his fanbase","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"38d1d6934c5662e937494fd39e30f608dcdecb7b1ed93024f384fd75e467e6ca"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Pomodoro technique","evidence":"[D18:3 | 3:59 pm on 16 November, 2023] Tim: Ouch, bummer about the injury. Hang tight. This week has been swamped with exams for me but I'm plowing through.\n[D18:7 | 3:59 pm on 16 November, 2023] Tim: That's cool! I like breaking up my studying into smaller parts. 25 minutes on, then 5 minutes off for something fun. It's less overwhelming and keeps me on track.","itemId":"urn:uuid:b8d9081e-11b2-5aa4-b455-ec74e5f07e8c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:caccd49fcb1921eae05fc51fdc89405f2f81db5606b1f229e94e2562307d6da5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which popular time management technique does Tim use to prepare for exams?","referenceAnswer":"Pomodoro technique","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"caccd49fcb1921eae05fc51fdc89405f2f81db5606b1f229e94e2562307d6da5"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"She gets too tired from her engineering coursework","evidence":"[D3:11 | 7:03 pm on 1 February, 2023] Jolene: Well... we planned to play the console with my partner.\n[D2:30 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Jolene: We are planning to play \"Walking Dead\" next Saturday.","itemId":"urn:uuid:b931ad50-4790-58d6-b4d4-4bd2180efe15","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b9efeb3294034e73953456a6aadacf69d0987ca0f17d31b9dc33c5436b0ccb9b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Why did Jolene sometimes put off doing yoga?","referenceAnswer":"She's more interested in playing video games","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b9efeb3294034e73953456a6aadacf69d0987ca0f17d31b9dc33c5436b0ccb9b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Cooper, Rex, Charlie","evidence":"[D12:1 | 10:05 am on 11 July, 2023] Andrew: Hey! So much has changed since last time we talked - meet Toby, my puppy. He's a bundle of joy and I couldn't resist taking him home, city living and all. How've you been?\n[D24:6 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Andrew: I named him Buddy because he's my buddy and I hope him and Toby become buddies!\n[D28:8 | 9:02 am on 22 November, 2023] Andrew: It took us a while to decide, but we ended up going with 'Scout' for our pup - it seemed perfect for their adventurous spirit.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bc3dd010-beb7-57e5-96bb-75d157f42ce9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What are the names of Andrew's dogs?","referenceAnswer":"Toby, Scout, Buddy","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f26b50a605a9c9abdb092283956861a9c2f0a9815339c9fbf96fc80342f1200b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Two Priuses","evidence":"[D1:2 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam! Good to see you! Yeah, I just got back from a trip with my family in my new Prius.\n[D1:4 | 1:47 pm on 18 May, 2023] Evan: My old prius broke down, decided to get it repaired and sell it. Glad you asked, we went to Rockies, check it out.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bcfbc112-df76-50d4-bdf2-06e4cb0133d9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:bba08b5bb6bb380da85e8d78c6771013e41a609e59984238af272474d1a9fe10","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many Prius has Evan owned?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"bba08b5bb6bb380da85e8d78c6771013e41a609e59984238af272474d1a9fe10"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Around early to mid March 2023","evidence":"[D9:5 | 11:22 am on 13 March, 2023] Deborah: Thanks! My neighbors were interested in trying yoga, so I hosted a class for them on Friday. It was great to see everyone embrace and enjoy it. Here is our photo together.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bfc1c407-403c-5e0a-a5ef-bcbdcf859a4f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6a01ada51b98452bbe9515ba13a4abd015fba9593495abdc38f6ea20d7c3f68a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Deborah start the yoga class in the neighborhood?","referenceAnswer":"Friday before 13 March, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6a01ada51b98452bbe9515ba13a4abd015fba9593495abdc38f6ea20d7c3f68a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A couple of her scripts that dealt with emotional themes","evidence":"[D14:1 | 5:44 pm on 3 June, 2022] Joanna: Nate, after finishing my screenplay I got a rejection letter from a major company. It really bummed me out.\n[D3:1 | 9:27 am on 7 February, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! The screenplay I sent in to the film festival has been on my mind all day everyday. I keep bouncing between crazy emotions like relief, excitement and worry! Fingers crossed a producer or director falls in love with it and it ends up on the big screen - that would be awesome!\n[D2:7 | 2:01 pm on 23 January, 2022] Joanna: Woohoo, Nate! I'm feeling a rollercoaster of emotions - relief, excitement, some anxiety - over finishing this project. Now I'm gonna submit it to some film festivals and (hopefully) get producers and directors to check it out. Here's hoping!\n[D24:12 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Joanna: Well, I had a bit of a setback recently - another rejection from a production company.\n[D24:13 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Nate: Bummer, Joanna. Is this the one you sent to a film contest? Rejections suck, but don't forget they don't define you. Keep at it and you'll find the perfect opportunity.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bff2a516-6d7c-51ba-8f4b-4c9aec2fdf4a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:041ecea49baad227ccd45150e80c916bfb8387fedb6eca48fd6cd0a87b4fde36","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which of Joanna's screenplay were rejected from production companies?","referenceAnswer":"first screenplay on drama and romance, third screenplay on loss identity and connection","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"041ecea49baad227ccd45150e80c916bfb8387fedb6eca48fd6cd0a87b4fde36"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Near the water","evidence":"[D16:16 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Thanks, Sam. Your kind words and support mean a lot. It's great to have you here. I'm gonna stay positive and keep going. Cheers!\n[D16:18 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Yeah, it's this peaceful place close to my home. I often go there to relax and unwind.\n[D16:20 | 9:13 pm on 9 November, 2023] Evan: Oh, I wish I could bring you along. That picture was actually taken last Friday at my favorite spot by the beach. Watching the waves and the sunset colors really helps me find peace, especially during tough times. It's a beautiful reminder of nature's resilience. We should definitely plan to go together someday.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c0d6120f-4b55-56aa-ad33-363077f024d9","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:021d8615adf219e18a2d6817e1862ec7be4e95cb946d3b1a26cb61b733ae274a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Does Evan live close to a beach or mountains?","referenceAnswer":"beach","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"021d8615adf219e18a2d6817e1862ec7be4e95cb946d3b1a26cb61b733ae274a"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Jolene is about 23 years old.","evidence":"[D8:2 | 7:18 pm on 2 March, 2023] Jolene: One of my favorite dishes is lasagna! Comfort food can be a great pick-me-up. I've got a lot going on with my studies and exams.\n[D13:5 | 3:56 pm on 6 June, 2023] Jolene:  I'm interning at a well-known engineering firm. It's been a great opportunity to test my skills and gain real-world experience. These are my new colleagues!\n[D21:6 | 9:34 am on 24 August, 2023] Jolene: My goal is to be successful in my field and make a positive impact. I've been studying, attending workshops, and networking to make it happen. Recently, I had the opportunity to present at a virtual conference and received positive feedback.  It was a great experience and confirmed that I'm on the right track.\n[D21:8 | 9:34 am on 24 August, 2023] Jolene: I was thrilled to receive such positive feedback! It felt so rewarding to know that my efforts were appreciated. Right now, I'm focusing on studying and gaining more experience. I'm even thinking about more internships to further enhance my skills. Exciting times! Hopefully, there will be more updates to share with you soon.\n[D22:6 | 5:33 pm on 26 August, 2023] Jolene: Yeah, Deborah! We've been figuring out how to add these values into our projects. As an engineering student, I want to use my talents to do good and help solve important problems. I'm keen on coming up with new ideas and making things more efficient to make the world a better place. Going further, my mom stressed the value of helping others and that's something I want to keep in mind for my engineering projects.\n[D22:14 | 5:33 pm on 26 August, 2023] Jolene: It helps with challenges, giving balance and strength. Any tips for staying relaxed while studying?\n[D24:2 | 2:14 pm on 3 September, 2023] Jolene: Hey Deb, great to hear from you! I've been focusing on studying and my relationship with my partner. We're taking little trips to the beach, it's a great way to relax. How about you, anything new going on?\n[D24:14 | 2:14 pm on 3 September, 2023] Jolene: Got a lot of finals coming up this month, so I've been studying real hard. It's been quite stressful, but it'll be worth it in the end. Thinking about taking a trip somewhere to relax and recharge afterward.\n[D25:5 | 8:31 pm on 6 September, 2023] Jolene: Yeah, same! It helps me stay balanced during my studies.\n[D26:6 | 7:39 pm on 8 September, 2023] Jolene: Having a routine helps me stay on top of everything I need to do. I have a schedule for classes, studying, and personal time. Self-care activities like yoga and meditation help me stay balanced and relax.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c1880b76-0ad5-5f37-a379-a425ddf48190","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d8bc46fa7787e1775916446f53f23dee02d7c7b3fae2f2e41cb672566086d4af","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How old is Jolene?","referenceAnswer":"likely no more than 30; since she's in school","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d8bc46fa7787e1775916446f53f23dee02d7c7b3fae2f2e41cb672566086d4af"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Italy and France.","evidence":"[D13:24 | 3:18 pm on 4 May, 2023] Maria: Last year I took a solo trip and took this pic in Spain. It reminded me that life is hard but there's still hope and beauty. It made me realize the importance of relying on my inner strength and appreciating small moments even more.\n[D8:15 | 6:03 pm on 6 March, 2023] Maria: Thanks, John! I got the idea from that trip to England a few years ago - I was mesmerized by the castles. I wanted to bring that same magic to my home, like a reminder of the world's beauty. I made a painting too!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c276e373-a8fa-53d3-b24a-02f5e50fa4e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:994a2a0e0aa9f95ab5cc19cb7388549302df9a75c7eba25b43b4e78e40a5688e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What European countries has Maria been to?","referenceAnswer":"Spain, England","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"994a2a0e0aa9f95ab5cc19cb7388549302df9a75c7eba25b43b4e78e40a5688e"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Wildlife biologist or a similar research position working for the Fish and Wildlife Service.","evidence":"[D2:18 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Andrew: That pic is so cute! It would be fun to hang out with a dog, cuddling away. Got me thinking of my old hiking pics and how much I miss exploring nature trails with my family's dog. Ah, the peaceful moments out in nature!\n[D3:1 | 4:19 pm on 16 April, 2023] Andrew: Hey Audrey! What's up? Missed chatting with ya! Check it out, my girl & I tried out that new cafe scene in the city last weekend! Super fun but kinda sad not being out in nature - that's when I feel like I'm really thriving. Oh man, I miss the peacefulness of being out on a hike.\n[D5:7 | 10:47 am on 6 May, 2023] Andrew: I'm looking for a place near a park or woods, so I can stay close to nature and give the dog a large open space to run around\n[D8:27 | 5:23 pm on 13 June, 2023] Andrew: Agreed! It's great for refreshing the mind and giving a different outlook. Whenever I'm in need of a reset, I turn to nature.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c2bf5232-899e-594d-85c1-f4eb24b651f6","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d73b6ca105a5feebf5f050edf606d893fdca9b3914253df68f893eec89006939","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is a career that Andrew could potentially pursue with his love for animals and nature?","referenceAnswer":"Park ranger or a similar position working for the National Park Services.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d73b6ca105a5feebf5f050edf606d893fdca9b3914253df68f893eec89006939"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Later in the fall of 2023","evidence":"[D7:6 | 7:54 pm on 17 August, 2023] Tim: I have no big events coming up, but I'm hoping to attend a book conference next month. It's an interesting gathering of authors, publishers and book lovers where we talk about our favorite novels and new releases. I'm excited to go because it'll help me learn more about literature and create a stronger bond to it.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c2ff4191-0369-54f1-b131-26611d252174","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:4521e43f2c71beb38ddac3d8031309054b33568b3e3f10ff67d609341b230484","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When is Tim attending a book conference?","referenceAnswer":"September 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"4521e43f2c71beb38ddac3d8031309054b33568b3e3f10ff67d609341b230484"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"No, some had issues.","evidence":"[D27:10 | 10:49 am on 29 October, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, photography has been great for me! The car project is doing well - I just finished restoring it and it looks amazing. Wanna come by and check it out? How's everything with the music? Any updates?\n[D13:7 | 5:22 pm on 11 August, 2023] Dave: I've been working on this car, doing engine swaps and suspension modifications. Now I'm learning about body modifications. Giving this classic muscle car a modern twist is a challenge but so fun!\n[D25:17 | 2:17 pm on 23 October, 2023] Dave: Thanks Calvin! It was a fun project. I restored a car last year, but I sold it to a collector. Now I'm working on something new, and it's quite a challenge! Take a look at this wonderful car!\n[D20:1 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, good to catch up again! Had a tough time with my car project. Worked on the engine of the vintage Mustang, thought I'd fixed it, but when I started it up, heard a weird noise. So disappointing after putting so much work in. Take a look at the engine!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c4e085d3-4305-52a8-9912-b56c97454ee2","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f22355156139ae95f900a91627ff603d6eb1110175516f98da8bce860e0a6bb4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Do all of Dave's car restoration projects go smoothly?","referenceAnswer":"No","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f22355156139ae95f900a91627ff603d6eb1110175516f98da8bce860e0a6bb4"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Real life experiences and challenges people face","evidence":"[D25:10 | 2:17 pm on 23 October, 2023] Calvin: Yeah, for sure! Recently, I've been really inspired by some of the struggles that people go through. It's made me dig deeper into my music to try to capture those feelings.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c51bbd1d-d46d-5468-ba05-6ea61eb8de43","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:fd41b678227e4baa4281a325e2fc1a52d6f7723063796b86674bd052fb61aa3b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What inspired Calvin's recent music?","referenceAnswer":"Struggles that people go through","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"fd41b678227e4baa4281a325e2fc1a52d6f7723063796b86674bd052fb61aa3b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
