{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A few times","evidence":"[D11:7 | 9:48 am on 8 July, 2023] Andrew: Yeah definitely ! I'm down for a hike with you and your furry friends. Let's do it next month when the weather is more pleasant. Here's the trail that I think it'd be great for the dogs.\n[D24:13 | 6:12 pm on 19 October, 2023] Audrey: I can't wait for our hike with the furry friends next month - it's gonna be awesome!\n[D26:20 | 2:36 pm on 28 October, 2023] Andrew: Yay! Does Saturday sound good? We can grab some snacks and have a blast exploring. Because on Sunday I am going on a picnic date with my girlfriend.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c5f92f93-f2fc-5146-b337-a8791e47444a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:26147c8d48d793632d7ee24b1667d20ac8bbd21edaf9487d9cbbcc2f6e50e794","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many times did Audrey and Andew plan to hike together?","referenceAnswer":"three times","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"26147c8d48d793632d7ee24b1667d20ac8bbd21edaf9487d9cbbcc2f6e50e794"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"become a sports commentator since he enjoys analyzing games and public speaking","evidence":"[D11:19 | 8:17 pm on 21 September, 2023] John: I've thought about it a lot. I want to use my platform to make a positive difference and inspire others - maybe even start a foundation and do charity work. It's important to me to make the most of the chances I get and leave a meaningful legacy.\n[D26:1 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Great to hear from you. My week's been busy - I started doing seminars, helping people with their sports and marketing. It's been awesome!\n[D27:26 | 5:26 pm on 2 January, 2024] John: He's a great leader and puts others first - that's why he eventually becomes king.","itemId":"urn:uuid:c7059383-1ee4-576b-8e5d-dbc789e5b56a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:69c96bc0243eddc344014dbf2de8f90b0f2cc6370db608091d2891fac48d24eb","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What could John do after his basketball career?","referenceAnswer":"become a basketball coach since he likes giving back and leadership","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"69c96bc0243eddc344014dbf2de8f90b0f2cc6370db608091d2891fac48d24eb"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"March 2022","evidence":"[D3:5 | 12:40 am on 27 March, 2022] John: I've been playing for a month now, it's been tough but fun. How about you, how's it going?","itemId":"urn:uuid:c742bf7c-39ee-558c-89cf-de8949349419","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:f0873fe162f884606d60caf33afe3a345a82855dfa79c6f9df74ed462252d031","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John resume playing drums in his adulthood?","referenceAnswer":"February 2022","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"f0873fe162f884606d60caf33afe3a345a82855dfa79c6f9df74ed462252d031"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Last Friday before 15 July 2023","evidence":"[D5:1 | 1:36 pm on 3 July, 2023] Caroline: Since we last spoke, some big things have happened. Last week I went to an LGBTQ+ pride parade. Everyone was so happy and it made me feel like I belonged. It showed me how much our community has grown, it was amazing!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c83a7820-b436-5e87-a0e4-0ccf3e2fc285","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:dae47ddf3e0bc0c6b38571d766a327d0eb136ebfe8dc190a9dc95136b98b2ee5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to a pride parade during the summer?","referenceAnswer":"The week before 3 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"dae47ddf3e0bc0c6b38571d766a327d0eb136ebfe8dc190a9dc95136b98b2ee5"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Develop their skills and grow as players","evidence":"[D14:5 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] John: There are challenges, since everyone is so different. But it's been awesome gaining experience and adapting, motivating and encouraging everyone. It's been great to watch each of them develop and reach their goals - such a reward!","itemId":"urn:uuid:c9894323-8cfd-54b1-904b-0b787ab8bf27","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:794c42cd41849c295832f4bcefb285ccf0c5b7829bbd49607887b428d951ca43","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What has John been able to help the younger players achieve?","referenceAnswer":"reach their goals","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"794c42cd41849c295832f4bcefb285ccf0c5b7829bbd49607887b428d951ca43"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Several weeks of dedicated work","evidence":"[D14:11 | 12:35 am on 14 August, 2023] Dave: Yeah, the project is going great! Here's a pic of the car I'm restoring. It's pretty cool seeing it go from a beat-up mess to a real beauty.\n[D20:1 | 8:57 pm on 22 September, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin, good to catch up again! Had a tough time with my car project. Worked on the engine of the vintage Mustang, thought I'd fixed it, but when I started it up, heard a weird noise. So disappointing after putting so much work in. Take a look at the engine!\n[D21:4 | 2:44 pm on 4 October, 2023] Dave: Wow, Calvin, that car looks great! Working on cars really helps me relax, it's therapeutic to see them come back to life. I've been working on that Ford Mustang I found in a junkyard - it was in bad shape, but I knew it had potential.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cacaff78-dd8c-56e0-908c-d0b84a796a0b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:e13e7a112b3f97ac987d41a47257d64a9f46898a1df52fb285143696b719bdd5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How long did Dave's work on the Ford Mustang take?","referenceAnswer":"nearly two months","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"e13e7a112b3f97ac987d41a47257d64a9f46898a1df52fb285143696b719bdd5"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Gastritis","evidence":"[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.","itemId":"urn:uuid:cafe8b3a-5c30-5906-9f93-1caee3b79853","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What digestive issue did Sam experience lately?","referenceAnswer":"Gastritis","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a6cbaaa17aead42adaef7abffe0193a7538ba1725ffab2b3c4d137a834603111"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
