{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Camping trip in the outdoors","evidence":"[D2:1 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, good to hear from you! Since we last talked, lots has been happening! Last weekend, I took my family on a road trip to Jasper. It was amazing! We drove through the Icefields Parkway and the glaciers and lakes were gorgeous. I got a shot of a glacier, check it out!\n[D2:3 | 7:11 pm on 24 May, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, thanks for asking! It was great - fresh air, peacefulness and a cozy cabin surrounded by mountains and forests made it feel like a real retreat.\n[D19:1 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, hope you're doing good. Wanted to share some amazing news - my partner is pregnant! We're so excited! It's been a while since we had a kiddo around.\n[D19:3 | 1:45 pm on 9 December, 2023] Evan: So excited and a bit nervous! It's been a while since I had a toddler around but I'm really looking forward to it. Parenthood is so rewarding. I still remember when my first child was born, the joy was amazing. Looking forward to witness the miracle of life and build more memories with my family!","itemId":"urn:uuid:de137cdb-f295-5a2d-87fb-c7e6224c5ce8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7089d8ebaf3f3bd5325a94fa3861f7f7a13ed42579b63324a4aaaa6e163db71b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which type of vacation would Evan prefer with his family, walking tours in metropolitan cities or camping trip in the outdoors?","referenceAnswer":"camping trip in the outdoors","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7089d8ebaf3f3bd5325a94fa3861f7f7a13ed42579b63324a4aaaa6e163db71b"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
