{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Sam faces challenges like dealing with cravings and managing his schedule. He addresses them by signing up for personal training sessions and seeking guidance from online forums and health blogs.","evidence":"[D4:2 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry about that. Don't worry, progress takes time. Let's work on it together.\n[D4:6 | 10:52 am on 27 July, 2023] Evan: I made some dietary changes, like cutting down on sugary snacks and eating more veggies and fruit, and it made a big impact on my health. Have you considered any changes?\n[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.\n[D14:2 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear about that. Gastritis can be tough. Taking care of ourselves is important. BTW, I've been focusing on fitness and it's been really beneficial for my overall well-being. Funny thing, I had another encounter with a lost tourist recently. Seems like helping tourists is becoming a recurring theme in my life!","itemId":"urn:uuid:e1a0b2be-58a2-5ac1-9413-f4671fc4dd1a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:a63ffca3fdc7f56327226a02a25a2ed0d70606100b68c1eb1ee28d19ff30f981","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What challenges does Sam face in his quest for a healthier lifestyle, and how does he address them?","referenceAnswer":"Sam faces challenges like maintaining motivation and making dietary changes. He addresses them by enrolling in cooking classes and seeking support from friends like Evan.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"a63ffca3fdc7f56327226a02a25a2ed0d70606100b68c1eb1ee28d19ff30f981"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"In early August 2023","evidence":"[D29:2 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: Hey Maria! Congrats on the recognition! It's really touching to see how much you're doing to help out. Last weekend, I participated in a community event to raise money for a good cause. We got a great turnout and it was amazing to be surrounded by so many supportive people.\n[D29:4 | 8:06 pm on 9 August, 2023] John: I set up a 5K charity run in our neighborhood. It was all for a good cause - to help out veterans and their families. We were able to raise some funds! Here's a pic from the day.","itemId":"urn:uuid:e2d8e182-bff1-5d4e-aab9-6ef73797c0e5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did John participate in a 5K charity run?","referenceAnswer":"first weekend of August 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"37c10324bf98efe8b896c4512a1143f1ff2e9763f04c9e12719e40eb57e49ed5"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
