{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"It reminds her of her mom.","evidence":"[D12:3 | 4:30 pm on 9 April, 2023] Deborah: My mom was interested in art. She believed art could give out strong emotions and uniquely connect us. When I go to an art show, it's like we're still experiencing it together even though she's gone. It's hard but comforting.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ef08cb5f-f470-58bd-b027-e0f26410b44e","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:450e91e73d3aa85293ea90919d2d6b875584b0897d632a16289d14ecad637750","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What does Deborah find comforting about going to art shows?","referenceAnswer":"It makes her feel like she's still experiencing it with her mom","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"450e91e73d3aa85293ea90919d2d6b875584b0897d632a16289d14ecad637750"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Japanese import sports cars","evidence":"[D4:5 | 6:24 pm on 1 May, 2023] Dave: Thanks! Appreciate the support. My dream was to open a shop and it's a step towards my other dream of working on classic cars. I love their design and engineering.\n[D1:2 | 11:53 am on 23 March, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin! Nice to meet you too! Things have been going well since we last talked. I attended this awesome event recently. It was like a car lover's paradise! They had so many classic cars on show, I was in awe. I even had the opportunity to speak with some of the owners and hear their fascinating stories. It was super inspiring. What about you? Anything exciting happening in your life lately?\n[D3:12 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Dave: Last weekend I went to a car show. Classic cars are so charming and the dedication people put into restoring them is amazing. That's why I'm so into auto engineering. Can't wait to show you some when you come to Boston! Oh, almost forgot to send a photo, look at this beautiful car!\n[D4:7 | 6:24 pm on 1 May, 2023] Dave: I'm obsessed with classic cars. They have a unique charm. I was so thrilled to restore one last year—nothing like bringing it back to life! Take a look at the engine of the restored car.","itemId":"urn:uuid:f0ed37dc-99b1-5fc9-93c9-229416816e83","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7ab8cc9a6552fe51d6484bc4a659f7d81f91298b37d1a360d4dcce0703331000","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which types of cars does Dave like the most?","referenceAnswer":"classic vintage cars","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7ab8cc9a6552fe51d6484bc4a659f7d81f91298b37d1a360d4dcce0703331000"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
