{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"pilates, swimming","evidence":"[D4:12 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: When things get tough, just take a deep breath and remember why you're doing this. This is where I spend a lot of my time, teaching yoga. It's a great way to find balance and reconnect with ourselves. I bonded with Anna during yesterday's l yoga class.\n[D4:16 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: Yes, but this brought us closer to Anna! We supported each other, that means a lot.\n[D15:1 | 7:37 pm on 9 July, 2023] Deborah: Hey Jolene! I started a running group with Anna - it's awesome connecting with people who care about fitness!","itemId":"urn:uuid:f943ea1e-e2cf-5c8b-a120-839b051597a3","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6e57de658e7aa9efffb783bcb7800e278bab77a5f08073e4791d172b416227df","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which community activities have Deborah and Anna participated in?","referenceAnswer":"yoga, running","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6e57de658e7aa9efffb783bcb7800e278bab77a5f08073e4791d172b416227df"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Cooking show","evidence":"[D21:4 | 1:43 pm on 14 September, 2022] Nate: Hey Joanna, I'm no writer like you, but something pretty awesome happened. Last Monday I got to teach people vegan ice cream recipes on my own cooking show! It was a bit nerve-wracking to put myself out there, but it was a blast. Plus, I picked up a few new recipes!","itemId":"urn:uuid:fc58d92e-35e0-5e5e-aa4a-fbdc004eae65","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:2cb64e2347af1a63435cd71a7d1fb99a516c0784547c3d16e0b1c270cbb1bff4","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What type of show did Nate host where he taught vegan ice cream recipes?","referenceAnswer":"a cooking show","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"2cb64e2347af1a63435cd71a7d1fb99a516c0784547c3d16e0b1c270cbb1bff4"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
