{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Clean eating, gym membership, cycling, yoga","evidence":"[D8:1 | 6:17 pm on 19 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan, some big news: I'm on a diet and living healthier! Been tough, but I'm determined.\n[D9:1 | 10:18 am on 27 August, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! Exciting news: I started a new diet and exercise routine last Monday and it's made a huge difference. I feel great! What about you, what changes have you made recently?\n[D21:9 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Sam: Wish I could feel the same about love, but I've started to enjoy running in the mornings, and it's been a great way to clear my head. What can you do, right?\n[D22:1 | 11:00 am on 31 December, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I’m really getting into this healthier lifestyle—just took my friends on an epic hiking trip last Friday!","itemId":"urn:uuid:ff9b4ee9-db98-5e2f-ab68-bf3aebc94401","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7b35c55b8ed8e8af03931057c832900362f8fbe9dfb8492542aceddef42037c8","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What new diet and lifestyle change did Sam adopt over time?","referenceAnswer":"Healthy eating, exercise routine, running, hiking","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7b35c55b8ed8e8af03931057c832900362f8fbe9dfb8492542aceddef42037c8"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"A cookout at the community center where veterans could meet local employers and access resources.","evidence":"[D15:13 | 7:38 pm on 20 May, 2023] John: Thanks, Maria! We had a great time throwing a small party and inviting some veterans to share their stories. It was awesome seeing them make connections and find camaraderie. All the smiles and new friendships made it really heartwarming.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ffbb69fd-9d51-55f6-84ed-405306af278c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:adbbada03ccae58c5f522bb091b3ac58367a1e16aea6ac46a90a22c491fafad9","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What did John host for the veterans in May 2023 as part of the project?","referenceAnswer":"a small party to share their stories","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"adbbada03ccae58c5f522bb091b3ac58367a1e16aea6ac46a90a22c491fafad9"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
{"item":{"candidateAnswer":"Around mid-July 2023","evidence":"[D8:9 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Caroline: That photo is stunning! So glad you bonded over our love of nature. Last Friday I went to a council meeting for adoption. It was inspiring and emotional - so many people wanted to create loving homes for children in need. It made me even more determined to adopt.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ffe11250-2e83-5138-b47f-6ee4ce0554f8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to the adoption meeting?","referenceAnswer":"The friday before 15 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170"}}]},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/binary-judgment/item-bank-entry/v1"}
